{"server":"cn","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_08_end","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_08","title":"童话的开场","storyCode":"SS-8","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"5de5e19faa820121880aa6c37d6495328e866e533dc826188b105fd8800a9b3d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一场酣畅淋漓的演奏后，Ave{@nbs}Mujica的大家终于回到了梦城堡。闹剧终将收场，Ave{@nbs}Mujica会作为Ave{@nbs}Mujica继续存在着。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i12"},{"type":"narration","text":"最后一个音符落定，祥子的手仍停留在键盘上。\n空荡荡的城堡里，还萦绕着方才音乐的微弱回响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......小，祥......？"},{"type":"narration","text":"许久未闻，却又再熟悉不过的声音在她的身旁响起。她缓缓抬起了头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的......终于......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......终于见面了呢，小祥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感觉好像做了一个很长很长的梦，差点醒不过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小祥，我们真的兜兜转转了好久，差点又要错过了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"而站在祥子面前的，除了初华，还有其他的乐队成员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就好像被人拉了一把，然后就出现在了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀~干嘛突然这么认真啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥，你现在笑得很开心。"},{"type":"narration","text":"头顶的聚光灯闪烁着，晃得祥子有些睁不开眼，也让眼前的一切都显得那么不真实，就像又一场梦一样。\n可她知道，她知道的——\n她们再一次合奏了属于她们的歌。\nAve{@nbs}Mujica的大家，终于回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！当然，我现在很开心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"初华......睦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若麦......海铃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我真的......很想你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位——欢迎回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（挣扎的哼唧声）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这些家伙让我们昏睡的吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦境，没有用了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不能离开......你们必须......留在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（尖锐的嘶鸣声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——大家小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃尔夫！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲丝，别再错下去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别拿你刚从书里学来的话教训我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，你带着她们——呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃尔夫话音未落，密密麻麻的丝线瞬间刺穿了它的双臂，一缕缕棉花从孔洞中涌了出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！快看天上——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不计其数的卡尔顿在头顶的天空中纷飞，织出一张巨大的梦网。\n梦网一点点朝少女们逼近，而且越来越大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲丝......别再执迷不悟了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一把巨大的剪刀从空中落下，梦网瞬间被剪碎成了一根根飘摇的丝线，散落在空中，纷纷扬扬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（慌乱的嘶鸣声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女在空中抽搐了两下，紧接着从高空落下，速度越来越快——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我们得救了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这到底是怎么回事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我们来晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱、爱丽丝小姐......！幸亏有你的帮助，谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"见到熟悉的仙女，松了一口气的同时，一股无法抗拒的倦意袭来，祥子感到自己的身体不受控制，整个人径直地往地上砸去。\n沉闷的声音响彻整个大厅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小祥——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥子......祥子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（是谁......这次又是谁......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"五感一点点地恢复，祥子隐约闻到了一股淡淡的香味。\n缓缓睁开眼，她发觉自己正躺在柔软的丝绒沙发上，而身旁坐着一位棕发的少女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你醒啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你穿梭了太多次梦境，身体实在无法承受负荷，所以才晕倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过作为完全没有接触过这类源石技艺的人，你能坚持那么久已经非常让人意外了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那其他人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心，我已经为她们安排好了房间，贝娜正在陪着她们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我好像还没有正式向你介绍自己——我叫爱丽丝，是梦城堡的现任主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在梦里已经见过了许多次......如果这是我们的第一次相见，那之前的你又是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经见过了莫菲丝的能力——梦城堡的仙女中有一群特别的人，拥有罕见的造梦源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这种能力并非无所不能，施术者创造的梦境始终受限于她对被施术者的认知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲丝一开始并不了解你，也并没有将你视为势均力敌的对手，所以才会创造出那个有瑕疵的梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于你为什么会见到我，我想，应该是外婆的功劳吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，外婆是梦城堡的上一任主人。她因为身体不好，现在一直在一间隐蔽的房间里休养。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她之前送了我一条项链，但这几天它里面的能量一直都很躁动，保险起见，我和贝娜连夜赶了回来......没想到发生了这么严重的事故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_rainsplash"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的老妇人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那边刚发生了点事，你一个人去不安全。赶紧绕路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴着帽子的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢提醒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我听附近的老奶奶说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你快回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卖花的妇人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜黑灯暗，可不要再迷路了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子小姐，作为梦城堡的主人，我为发生的这一切向你道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但莫菲丝做了那样过分的事，你也很难原谅她吧......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我本来应该对她有所怨恨，但现在心中好像并没有这种情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实正如她所说，Ave{@nbs}Mujica从来都不是一个紧密相连的团体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一开始同意和她打赌，只是想要尽快把乐队成员带回来，谈不上是冷静的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可当我进入每个成员的梦境，然后被她们一一拒绝时，我才发现自己根本不了解她们的内心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在她创造的梦里，我们每个人都只想用看似美好的那面去掩盖内心最脆弱的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我有尝试去了解这些曾与我日夜相处的伙伴吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做好承担他人人生的觉悟了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在“无梦之境”的深渊坠落时，我无数次这样质问自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而当我终于解开心结，将我的伙伴们一个个唤醒，再次站在莫菲丝的面前时，除了最初的愤怒，还有一种莫名的情绪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一种发自内心的悲伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一刻，我和她四目相对。我突然意识到，我的力量不再单薄，我还有身边的伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而她的身边，依然只有她一人，和那些完全遵循她意志的造物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是造梦的人，她比我们任何一人都要清楚，梦境里的一切都是虚假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可她依然选择沉溺在一个又一个的梦境里，一定也有她的难言之隐吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，你是没有心的怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"难怪你爸妈都不要你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你活不过这个冬天的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不对，你们胡说！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们快走开！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦——快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲丝，你还好吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝姐姐，他、他们说的是真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他们是坏孩子对吧？仙女们是不会给他们美梦的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不是没有心的怪物，不是被父母抛弃的，我能活过这个冬天的，对吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲丝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爱丽丝姐姐，回答我！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出于某些原因，莫菲丝只能在梦城堡生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片大地并不像童话一般美好。莫菲丝曾经历的苦难，让她无法相信童话中的那些美梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我也深知，梦城堡的美梦并不能解决所有的问题......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“和现实比起来，我们的能力实在有限。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我们能做的，不过是在孩子们内心的最深处，留下一颗种子。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“它可能是年少时，心里觉得最重要的一件事，抑或是一个物品。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“它不会时刻强调自己的存在，但它会在关键的时刻、一个人最脆弱的时刻，给予他力量。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的这些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都是梦境里的你对我说的哦，爱丽丝小姐。现在，我把这些也说给你听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，或许莫菲丝也在等待着某个梦境，让她真正地“长大成人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"月亮升起之时，人偶获得生命——你看，月亮不是已经升起来了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"爱丽丝看向窗外，清冷的月光透过城堡的窗，温柔地洒在了她和祥子的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，爱丽丝小姐，我还有一个请求......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请说，我一定尽全力帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我们五个人都从梦境里苏醒了，但我们好像并没有回到我们原本的那个世界......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然爱丽丝小姐是梦城堡的主人，或许你知道能让我们回去的办法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你昏迷时，我听过她们描述你所说的那个“世界”。从她们的形容来看，的确不像是泰拉的某个城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你们的情况我的确从来没有遇到过，就算翻遍城堡的资料库也一无所获。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我准备求助一下罗德岛——罗德岛的博士颇有学识，应该能找到将你们送回去的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“罗德岛”......那个医药公司？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，你在梦里也见过罗德岛吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也想再去那里拜访，还有几个“老朋友”也想见见......欸......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，祥子小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我有点想不起来她们的模样了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"面对正在困惑的祥子，爱丽丝好像早有预料一样，轻轻地捧起了她的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经历过了这么多人的梦境，祥子小姐，你应该很熟悉梦城堡的规则了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如所有的梦境一样，从醒来的那一刻开始，关于它的记忆就在一点点地模糊消散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终有一天，你会回到属于你的“世界”，到那时，你会忘记我，忘记梦城堡的美梦，忘记泰拉的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会这样......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这里发生的一切并非毫无作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去以后，也许你和你的同伴又要重新解决你们的问题......但我相信你们一定会成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你忘记了在这里发生的一切，你也会记得，自己面对困难时的勇气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也相信......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到了原来的世界，Ave{@nbs}Mujica也会作为Ave{@nbs}Mujica继续存在着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为梦城堡的主人，我会永远记得你们现在“孩子”的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能某一天，我会再次出现在长大的你们面前呢——希望那时，你和你的伙伴仍在用音乐书写你们的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们约好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"门外是什么声音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会又有人在捣乱吧？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子快步打开了房门。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小祥——你终于醒了，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莽撞的卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（晕乎乎的哼唧声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，我没事......为什么外面会突然冒出这么大声响？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们正在布置新的舞台，贝娜小姐就让莫菲丝操控这些小家伙搬东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新的舞台......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对呀，也不知道我们还要在这待多久，不如趁着空闲时间多排练一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要练习的曲子还有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海铃","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来莫菲丝想直接在梦境里造一个新的舞台，但被我们和贝娜小姐否决了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这段时间都不想再做梦了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们就没有人关心一下我吗——为什么要我来当苦力啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（愤怒的哼唧声）"},{"type":"narration","text":"站在莫菲丝身旁的贝娜并没有多说什么，只是伸出了手，用力弹了一下莫菲丝毛茸茸的耳朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——痛痛痛！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（惨兮兮的哼唧声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲丝，既然犯错了，就应该接受相应的惩罚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃尔夫，你也别想逃，你去把最后的那盏灯装上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在众人的面前，沃尔夫双手伏地，很快变成了兽形。\n它轻松地叼起灯的电线，轻轻一跃，将其稳稳地挂在了顶棚上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，新的舞台还满意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好看呀——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"若麦飞快地跑上了舞台，在一个个精致的布景间来回穿梭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，这种事简简单单啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是忘了最重要的乐器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，别弹我耳朵了，我马上拿出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在莫菲丝捂着耳朵时，台上已经出现了每个人的乐器。大家纷纷走上台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若叶睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，还和以前一样顺手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麦","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（希望梦里荒废的那段时间不会影响到现实的肌肉记忆——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初华","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，我们都准备好了，你也来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子抬头看向台上的同伴们，灯光已经汇聚在了她们身上，而熟悉的键盘，也在呼唤着她的回归。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱丽丝","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"期待你们的表演，祥子小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前没机会欣赏你们完整的演出，这下可以弥补遗憾啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡尔顿们","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（开心的哼唧声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃尔夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能以非敌人的身份聆听你们的演奏，对我来说是最欣慰的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们怎么都在说一些客套话！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总、总之......我会竖起耳朵听的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗......哈哈哈哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你笑什么啊！不要以为爱丽丝姐姐和贝娜姐姐在，我就不敢做什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么......哈哈，我上台了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子抓住了队友伸来的手，走上了属于Ave{@nbs}Mujica的舞台。\n就像拼图拼完了最后一块，也许结果并没有那么令人惊喜，可唯有这一刻，一切才变得完整和圆满。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，在这片大地上，留下属于我们的声音吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i13"},{"type":"narration","text":"月光洒下之时，人偶获得暂时的生命。\n人偶的皮囊之下，藏着少女们的秘密。\n爱意，恐惧，悲伤，死亡，遗忘。\n在梦的城堡中，秘密与罪孽融合复生。\n高举烛台，踏破荆棘，拨开迷雾。\n新的童话，就此孕育。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这便是我们这些人偶的奇遇故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丰川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎来到......Ave{@nbs}Mujica的世界。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
